# Scenario name
msgid "Allies and Enemies"
msgstr "Allies and Enemies"

# Scenario description
msgid ""
"The Arlenians are your allies. The Kraylors and Exuari are your enemies and "
"will try to prevent you from completing your missions. Duration: "
"approximately 30 minutes\n"
"\n"
"Version 2 - Nov2024\n"
"\n"
"USN Discord: https://discord.gg/PntGG3a where you can join a game online. "
"There's one nearly every weekend. All experience levels are welcome."
msgstr "The Arlenians are your allies. The Kraylors and Exuari are your enemies and will try to prevent you from completing your missions. Duration: approximately 30 minutes\n\nVersion 2 - Nov2024\n\nUSN Discord: https://discord.gg/PntGG3a where you can join a game online. There's one nearly every weekend. All experience levels are welcome."

