msgstr "We fabricate general and specialised components for ship beam systems"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:2598
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"This station was named after Archimedes who, according to legend, used a "
"series of adjustable focal length mirrors to focus sunlight on a Roman naval "
"fleet invading Syracuse, setting fire to it"
msgstr "This station was named after Archimedes who, according to legend, used a series of adjustable focal length mirrors to focus sunlight on a Roman naval fleet invading Syracuse, setting fire to it"

