msgstr "We manufacture warp, impulse and jump engines for the human navy fleet as well as other independent clients on a contract basis"

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:2640
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"The station is named after the late 19th century astronaut as well as the "
"fictionlized stations that followed. The station initially constructed "
"entire space worthy vessels. In time, it transitioned into specializeing in "
"propulsion systems."
msgstr "The station is named after the late 19th century astronaut as well as the fictionlized stations that followed. The station initially constructed entire space worthy vessels. In time, it transitioned into specializeing in propulsion systems."

