"The original station builders were fans of the late 20th century scientist "
"and author Isaac Asimov. The station was initially named Foundation, but was "
"later changed simply to Asimov. It started off as a stellar observatory, "
"then became a supply stop and as it has grown has become an educational and "
"coordination hub for the region"
msgstr "The original station builders were fans of the late 20th century scientist and author Isaac Asimov. The station was initially named Foundation, but was later changed simply to Asimov. It started off as a stellar observatory, then became a supply stop and as it has grown has become an educational and coordination hub for the region"

