msgid "Sorry, sir, but you are as fully stocked as I can allow."
msgstr "Sorry, sir, but you are as fully stocked as I can allow."

#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:7978
#: scripts/scenario_38_allies_and_enemies.lua:8014
